WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:17.590
It is a historic meeting, Kim Jong-un has
become the first North Korean leader to visit

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:20.240
the south since the Korean war.

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:25.609
Families split either side of the Ethiopian-Eritrean
border finally able to speak to each other

00:00:25.609 --> 00:00:27.260
for the first time in decades.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:33.360
Far right candidate Jair Bolsonaro has won
Brazil’s presidential race.

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:36.740
Jacob Zuma will step down as South Africa’s president.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:48.620
The Irish people have voted in favor of scrapping
a constitutional ban on abortion.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:52.960
This is about women taking their rightful
place in Irish society finally.

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:57.730
A Chinese researcher claims to have helped make the world’s first births of genetically

00:00:57.730 --> 00:00:58.720
altered humans.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:05.540
A data analysis firm linked to the Trump campaign
retained the personal information of more

00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:07.140
than 50 million users.

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:12.440
We didn’t take a broad enough view of our
responsibility, and that was a big mistake.

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:21.200
17 people killed in connection with a mass shooting ...

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:23.300
A mass shooting at a Florida highschool... a synagogue in Pittsburgh...

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:24.700
The gunman opened fire...

00:01:25.340 --> 00:01:30.700
I don't want prayers. I don't want thoughts. I want gun control and

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:39.200
Thousands of students are expected to walk
out of their schools — a mass protest across

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:41.380
the nation against gun violence.

00:01:41.380 --> 00:01:47.479
A new report by the UN carries a stark warning. Millions more people will die from extreme

00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:49.360
heat by the year 2040.

00:01:49.360 --> 00:01:53.440
India’s Kerala state was hit by
the worst flooding it’s seen in a century.

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:58.440
A powerful, 7.5 magnitude earthquake struck  the
island of Sulawesi Friday.

00:01:58.450 --> 00:02:02.299
Several separate enormous wildfires are taking
a terrible toll.

00:02:02.299 --> 00:02:06.900
The stuff we lost isn’t as important as
the fact that our family’s all torn apart.

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:11.140
Yemen's humanitarian crisis is escalating
to devastating levels.

00:02:11.140 --> 00:02:15.820
The United Nations warns up to 13 million
civilians are at risk of starvation.

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:21.290
The administration's new crackdown on illegal
immigration at the border, over a six week

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:25.780
period nearly 2,000 kids were separated from
nearly as many adults.

00:02:25.780 --> 00:02:29.260
You know, they have a word. It sort of became old-fashioned.

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:31.420
It's called a "nationalist."

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:34.380
You know what I am? I'm a nationalist, okay.

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:38.800
In Paris, violent clashes erupted between
police and protesters for the third straight

00:02:38.810 --> 00:02:39.810
weekend.

00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:47.129
We pay so many taxes, it’s impossible now
to have a good life for us.

00:02:47.129 --> 00:02:51.109
This is Jamal Khashoggi captured on closed
circuit cameras, stepping into what Turkish

00:02:51.109 --> 00:02:53.520
authorities believe was a death trap.

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:55.980
I am here today not because I want to be.

00:02:57.920 --> 00:03:01.880
Look at me when I’m talking to you. You’re
telling me that my assault doesn’t matter.

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:04.520
That what happened to me doesn’t matter.

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:08.780
Bill Cosby becomes the first celebrity to be convicted in the Me Too era.

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:12.180
I've dreamt of this day for 32 years.

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:14.560
Abusers: your time is up.

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:16.519
The survivors are here.

00:03:16.519 --> 00:03:17.519
Standing tall.

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:25.360
Falling on your knees, praying.

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:28.660
What I know for sure is that speaking your

00:03:28.670 --> 00:03:33.980
truth is the most powerful tool we all have.

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:41.540
So I want all the girls watching here and
now to know that a new day is on the horizon.

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:45.739
The midterm elections were full of historic
firsts.

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:50.800
The first muslim women… first Native American
women… first openly gay man elected governor…

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:54.390
It means something, to kids and people, to

00:03:54.390 --> 00:03:57.220
see images that reflect themselves.

00:03:57.220 --> 00:03:58.620
It's historical.

00:03:58.620 --> 00:04:01.220
It moves me, like it moves me to tears.

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:05.280
That is going to have an impact, because imagery
does, you know, representation does.

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:08.480
France are the champions of the world!

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:12.080
All 12 boys and their soccer coach

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:15.240
have now been rescued from that flooded cave in Thailand.

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:21.380
An immigrant from Mali is being called a real
life Spider-Man after he rescued a child dangling

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:22.220
from a balcony.

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:22.960
Look at this.

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:27.460
You know, I guess one person can make a difference.

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:30.280
There are no limits to the human spirit.

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:31.760
Touchdown confirmed.

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:36.380
I believe what makes us unique is transcending
our limits.

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:42.000
I would much rather fail gloriously than not venture, not try.

